      "token_end_exclusive": 1857
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 602550,
      "end_ms": 603545,
      "text": "一副担当。",
      "token_start": 1857,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1861
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 604020,
      "end_ms": 607785,
      "text": "如果您也被这位母亲的格局打动，",
      "token_start": 1861,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1875
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 608190,
      "end_ms": 611445,
      "text": "如果您也认可这样的家风，",
